      "name": "Status",
      "description": "Whether EldenNet is healthy on this PC and game build, and if not, why.",
      "help": {
        "purpose": "Check, part by part, whether EldenNet runs as it should on this game build.",
        "steps": [
          "On Health, read the state and its reason, then whether this game build is supported.",
          "Look down EldenNet's parts: each says whether it runs and what it is doing.",
          "On Compatibility, check the versions of EldenNet and GraceUI, and how the game was started."
        ]
